  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="16px 32px 24px">
    <mj-column padding="0">
      <mj-raw><table class="img-text-wrap" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tr><td class="img-text-img" width="42%" valign="middle" style="width:42%;padding:0 16px 0 0;"><img src="img/billpay-batch-multicurrency.png" alt="" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td><td class="img-text-body" width="58%" valign="middle" style="width:58%;"><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px 0;">1. Pay anyone, anywhere - locally or overseas</div><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Fund local transfers via PayNow and FAST, or send to 40+ countries in 100+ currencies - all from one dashboard, in the same approval run.</div></td></tr></table>
      <table class="img-text-mobile" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tr><td class="img-text-body" width="100%" valign="middle" style="width:100%;padding:0;"><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px 0;">1. Pay anyone, anywhere - locally or overseas</div><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Fund local transfers via PayNow and FAST, or send to 40+ countries in 100+ currencies - all from one dashboard, in the same approval run.</div></td><td class="img-text-img" width="100%" valign="middle" style="width:100%;padding:0;"><img src="img/billpay-batch-multicurrency.png" alt="" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
    </mj-column>
  </mj-section>
  <mj-section padding="16px 32px 24px">
    <mj-column padding="0">
      <mj-raw><table class="img-text-wrap" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tr><td class="img-text-body" width="58%" valign="middle" style="width:58%;"><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px 0;">2. The right approvals and sign-off before money moves</div><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Bills route to the right approver by amount, fund however many are in the batch in a single action, and every approval is logged for a full audit trail.</div></td><td class="img-text-img" width="42%" valign="middle" style="width:42%;padding:0 0 0 16px;"><img src="img/billpay-approval.png" alt="" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td></tr></table>
      <table class="img-text-mobile" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tr><td class="img-text-body" width="100%" valign="middle" style="width:100%;padding:0;"><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px 0;">2. The right approvals and sign-off before money moves</div><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Bills route to the right approver by amount, fund however many are in the batch in a single action, and every approval is logged for a full audit trail.</div></td><td class="img-text-img" width="100%" valign="middle" style="width:100%;padding:0;"><img src="img/billpay-approval.png" alt="" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
