  <mj-section padding="16px 32px 24px">
    <mj-column padding="0">
      <mj-raw><table class="img-text-wrap" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tr><td class="img-text-img" width="42%" valign="middle" style="width:42%;padding:0 16px 0 0;"><img src="img/billpay-xero-sync-sg.png" alt="" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td><td class="img-text-body" width="58%" valign="middle" style="width:58%;"><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px 0;">3. Connect to Xero - and skip the manual reconciliation</div><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Once connected, every paid bill syncs to Xero automatically with the right accounting codes attached, and its status stays visible from pending to completed.</div></td></tr></table>
      <table class="img-text-mobile" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation"><tr><td class="img-text-body" width="100%" valign="middle" style="width:100%;padding:0;"><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.3;margin:0 0 12px 0;">3. Connect to Xero - and skip the manual reconciliation</div><div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Once connected, every paid bill syncs to Xero automatically with the right accounting codes attached, and its status stays visible from pending to completed.</div></td><td class="img-text-img" width="100%" valign="middle" style="width:100%;padding:0;"><img src="img/billpay-xero-sync-sg.png" alt="" width="100%" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;" /></td></tr></table></mj-raw>
