      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#03102F;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 4px 0;">No monthly subscription</div>
      <div style="font-family:Manrope, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#61667C;line-height:1.6;">Pay only for the transfers you make.</div>
